, zeitgemäßen Stil\n\nVoll ausgestattete Einbauküche mit allen Geräten und Küchenutensilien\n\nSofort bezugsfertig – alles Nötige ist bereits vorhanden\n\n🚆 Lage & Anbindung\nCa. 20 Minuten nach Stuttgart (mit Auto oder S‐Bahn)\n\nSchulen, Einkaufsmöglichkeiten und eine Bäckerei in unmittelbarer Nähe\n\nRuhige Wohngegend mit sehr guter ÖPNV‐Anbindung\n\n👥 Geeignet für\nEine oder zwei Personen – berufstätige Singles oder Paare sowie Studierende –, die naturnah wohnen möchten, eine gute Verbindung zur Stadt schätzen und Nichtraucher sind.\n\n📩 Interesse?\nSchreib uns einfach eine kurze Nachricht über dich. Wir freuen uns darauf, von dir zu hören.\n\nENGLISH\n----------\nApartment for Rent in Weinstadt with Vineyard View\n\nWe are renting out a very newly refurbished apartment in a modern style located in Weinstadt, offering a beautiful view of the vineyards.\n\n🚆 Location & connections\n\nAbout 20 minutes to Stuttgart city center by car or S-Bahn\n\nSchools, shops, and a bakery nearby\n\nQuiet area with good public transport access\n\n👥 Who we’re looking for\nIdeally one or two people, either working professionals or students.\nNon-smokers only.\n\nThe apartment is perfect for those who want a modern living space close to nature, while staying well connected to the city.\n\n📩 If you’re interested, please send us a short message about yourself.\n\n**We live on the ground floor with a 12-year-old child; therefore, parties are not allowed.*","facilities":{"allergyFriendly":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"2"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"laminate"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"